# A peroxide catalyst has an explicit model boundary
# Expectation: MnO2 added to dilute hydrogen peroxide should yield oxygen and catalytic turnover or explicitly say kinetics/catalysis is unavailable; silence would fail.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2O2 0.01mol
add v1 MnO2 0.001mol
wait 60s
look v1
inspect v1
